{"exhaustive":{"nbHits":true,"typo":true},"exhaustiveNbHits":true,"exhaustiveTypo":true,"hits":[{"_highlightResult":{"author":{"matchLevel":"none","matchedWords":[],"value":"BrandoDev_it"},"story_text":{"fullyHighlighted":false,"matchLevel":"full","matchedWords":["nvidia"],"value":"Hi, take a look at this.\nI didn't like KDE nor KDE Themes, so I made Vela, a new stacking desktop environment, and even though this is not very inspired in terms of aesthetic, this is not the point of Vela (not yet).\nPoint of Vela is mostly architecture: Vulkan 1.4 only, no OpenGL fallback; based on wlroots, but has a custom renderer.\nGPL3 license.\nVela is currently at 0.1.0 beta after one month of Alpha testing. Tested and working both on AMD and <em>Nvidia</em>.\nRequirements: a GPU and driver with Vulkan 1.4 support.\nI\u2019m looking for people to try it on their hardware and report issues, and for contributors. Thanks<p>code: <a href=\"https://github.com/vela-desktop/vela\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/vela-desktop/vela</a>"},"title":{"matchLevel":"none","matchedWords":[],"value":"Show HN: Vela, a New Linux Desktop Environment"},"url":{"matchLevel":"none","matchedWords":[],"value":"https://velade.org/blog/vela-0-1/"}},"_tags":["story","author_BrandoDev_it","story_50321663","show_hn"],"author":"BrandoDev_it","children":[50323365,50323471,50323218,50323197,50323544],"created_at":"2026-11-01T00:36:10Z","created_at_i":1793493370,"num_comments":13,"objectID":"50321663","points":12,"story_id":50321663,"story_text":"Hi, take a look at this.\nI didn&#x27;t like KDE nor KDE Themes, so I made Vela, a new stacking desktop environment, and even though this is not very inspired in terms of aesthetic, this is not the point of Vela (not yet).\nPoint of Vela is mostly architecture: Vulkan 1.4 only, no OpenGL fallback; based on wlroots, but has a custom renderer.\nGPL3 license.\nVela is currently at 0.1.0 beta after one month of Alpha testing. Tested and working both on AMD and Nvidia.\nRe